flowchart TD
    Start[MaintenanceTask]
    Need[DetermineMode]
    Inspect[InspectTarget]
    Match{ModeMatches}
    Capability{CapabilityPresent}
    Repair[ApplyMode]
    Confirm[VerifyMode]
    Error[ReportError]
    Continue[Continue]

    Start --> Need
    Need --> Inspect
    Inspect --> Match
    Match -->|yes| Continue
    Match -->|no| Capability
    Capability -->|yes| Repair
    Capability -->|no| Error
    Repair --> Confirm
    Confirm --> Match
